Package: keRnel
Title: Composable Covariance Kernels for Gaussian Processes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Térence", "Viellard", , "terence.viellard@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Provides a collection of composable covariance kernel functions
    for Gaussian Process models. Kernels are immutable S3 objects that can be
    combined with arithmetic operators ('+', '*') and wrapped to add
    batching, automatic relevance determination, block structure, or input
    dimension selection.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
